exports[`help appearance fixtures 80 columns: full grouped content, including less prominent diagnostics 1`] = `
"  Conversation
  /agents     Browse and follow agent conversations
  /questions  Open questions; Enter answers or picks skip, Esc/Tab closes
  /help       Commands and keyboard shortcuts; Esc closes

  Projects
  /projects              Browse projects: Enter opens, p pins, d deletes
  /rename <name>         Change display name only; project ID stays fixed
  /new [name] [git-url]  Create a project page
  /close                 Close this page; keep its project and history
  /quit                  Exit; keep conversation history

  Model & accounts
  /effort [level|default]        Show or set project/model reasoning effort
  /fast [on|off]                 Show or set project/model fast mode
  /models [id]                   Choose or set the project model
  /accounts                      Choose a subscription account
  /login claude|codex [profile]  Sign in to a subscription account

  Keyboard · navigation
  Ctrl+N             New orchestrator
  Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+X    Previous / next project page
  Ctrl+B             Open or close projects
  Ctrl+Q             Open or close questions; arrivals never open them
  PgUp/PgDn / wheel  Scroll conversation; scroll help while it is open
  Ctrl+C             Cancel selected turn/agent; twice within 2s exits,
                     keeping history
  Esc                Close panel, else leave agent view, else clear input

  Keyboard · editing
  Shift/Alt+Enter      New line
  Alt+←/→ / Alt+B/F    Move by word
  Alt+⌫ / Ctrl+W       Delete previous word
  Alt+D                Delete next word
  Home/End / Ctrl+A/E  Start / end of current line
  Ctrl+U / Ctrl+K      Delete to start / end of current line
  ↑ / ↓                Move between input rows, then project input history

  Advanced & diagnostics
  /keys               Diagnose terminal key chords; Esc ends
  /compact            Summarize model context; keep full history
  /review-rounds [n]  Review rounds before CI; 0 goes straight to CI"
`;

